# WFORMTV.KEY - the tag pick list of the item form's Tags in
# TEST/WFORMT.C with more tags in use than a code list holds: CTRL-INS
# tags items with them, and the list keeps the first LINK_MAXCODES, A-Z,
# titled incomplete; TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/WFORMTV.SNP.
K CTRL-INS
S CAPPED
K F3 ALT-G F4
S CAP
K ESC ESC
S ENDED
